# WattleAddr — Australian address autocomplete on the supplier and consignee
# address fields. Free tier is 5,000 lookups a month.
#
#   1. Sign up at https://wattleaddr.com.au
#   2. Create a PUBLISHABLE key (waddr_pk_…) in the console
#   3. Lock it to your domains — shinemotorinvoice.vercel.app and localhost
#
# Publishable keys are meant to be in the browser; they only work from the
# domains listed in the console. Never put a secret key here — this file and
# anything VITE_-prefixed is compiled into the bundle and served to everyone.
#
# Left blank, the address field is an ordinary text box and everything still
# works. The yard must be able to write a docket with a third-party service
# unreachable, out of quota, or not set up yet.
VITE_WATTLEADDR_KEY="waddr_sk_test_Aykjt7bRDxoVh0zYuR9Ga4xWlZOU"
